      "Language": "fre",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "We report a case of ruptured ovarian molar pregnancy, diagnosed in the context of haemorragic shock 19 days following evacuation of an intrauterine hydatiform mole. To our knowledge, this is the first reported case of heterotopic molar pregnancy."},
